<deviceset name="OLED_096_I2C_4P" prefix="DISP">
<description>OLED display 0.96 inch, 128 x 64, I2C (4 pins). Monochrome OLED module with a 4-pin I2C header (GND, VCC, SCL, SDA), four corner mounting holes, the glass panel's flex cable folded behind the board. Most modules like this use the SSD1306 controller at I2C address 0x3C; the controller on this one is not read yet. Store location: kit.</description>
