<devicesets>
<deviceset name="BUZZER_TMB12A03" prefix="BZ">
<description>Active buzzer TMB12A03, 3 V, 12 mm. Active magnetic buzzer: it has its own oscillator, so plain DC on its legs gives a steady tone of about 2.3 to 2.4 kHz (no PWM needed). Rated 3 V. The + leg is marked on the body and the seal sticker. The seal keeps flux out during washing: peel it off after soldering, or the buzzer stays quiet. Store location: kit.</description>
