<devicesets>
<deviceset name="TACT_SWITCH_6X6" prefix="SW">
<description>Tactile push button 6 x 6 mm, through-hole, 4 legs. Momentary push button: pressing it connects its two contacts, letting go opens them. Four legs in a 6.5 x 4.5 mm rectangle; each leg is joined inside to the leg straight across the body (6.5 mm), and the two legs on the same side (4.5 mm) are the switch. On an ESP32: one contact to a GPIO, the other to GND, with the pin's internal pull-up on (pressed reads 0). Store location: kit.</description>
<gates>
<gate name="G$1" symbol="TACT_SWITCH_6X6" x="0" y="0"/>
</gates>
